[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]
\draw (0,-2.2)--(9,-2.2);
\draw (0,2.2)--(9,2.2) node[midway,above] {$9\text{ mm}$};
\draw (0,0) ellipse (0.66 and 2.2);
\draw (9,2.2) arc[start angle=90,end angle=-90,x radius=0.66,y radius=2.2];
\draw[dashed] (9,2.2) arc[start angle=90,end angle=270,x radius=0.66,y radius=2.2];
\draw[-{Stealth}] (-2.4,-4)--(-0.35,-1.2);
\node[below left] at (-2.5,-4.1) {$A = 20\text{ mm}^{2}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
The area of the circular cross-section is shown. What is the volume of this cylinder, in mm³?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.42]
\draw (-5,0)--(-5,8);
\draw (5,0)--(5,8) node[midway,right] {$8\text{ m}$};
\draw (0,8) ellipse (5 and 1.5);
\draw (-5,0) arc[start angle=180,end angle=360,x radius=5,y radius=1.5];
\draw[dashed] (-5,0) arc[start angle=180,end angle=0,x radius=5,y radius=1.5];
\fill (0,8) circle (2pt);
\draw (0,8)--(5,8) node[midway,above,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] {$5\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
What is the volume of this cylinder in exact form, in terms of $\pi$?

